/*
 * Roots and vines attack you
 */
:: Fishing Forest Lake Plant Attack
You're leaning back on the rock, rod in hand, when roots surge up through the soil and tangle around your legs. You drop your rod as you are pulled away from the waters edge.
<br><br>

<<link [[Fight|Fishing Forest Lake Plant Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Plant Interrupt Attack
<<run endFishingCombat()>>
You're focused on catching the fish on your line, when suddenly roots surge up through the soil and tangle around your legs, spreading them apart and picking you off the ground.

<<set $leftleg to "bound">><<set $rightleg to "bound">>
<br><br>

<<link [[Fight|Fishing Forest Lake Plant Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Plant Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<molested>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<set $enemytype to "tentacles">>
	<<tentaclestart 10 15 "root" "vine" true>>
	<<forestRescueSetup>>
<</if>>

<<statetentacles>>

<<effects>>
<<effectstentacles>>

<<forestRescueCheck>>

<<tentacles>>
<<actionstentacles>>

<<if $tentacles.active lte ($tentacles.max / 2)>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Plant Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Plant Molestation]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Plant Molestation Finish
<<set $fishing.lake.event to "none">>
<<set $fishing.lake.eventDanger to 0>>
<<if $alarm is 1 and $rescue is 1>>
	<<forestRescue>>
<<else>>
	The vines lose interest in you, and withdraw into the mud. <<tearful>> you stand up and untangle your rod from the vines.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Forest Lake Plant [widget]
/* Text that can appear while waiting if vines will attack soon */
<<widget "fishingForestLakePlantAttackWaitAmbient">>
	<<addinlineevent 20>>
		<<print either(
			"The smell of flowers drifts across the water, sweet and intoxicating.",
			"You notice the vines hanging from nearby trees are curling in an odd way."
		)>>
		<<set $fishing.lake.eventDanger += 1>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</widget>>
